warn  Global Secure Access  Microsoft Entra Global Secure Access client installed (running)
      note: Microsoft documents that this client doesn't tunnel virtual machines' traffic and
            isn't supported on devices that host VMs. Sandboxes have no network of their own:
            their traffic leaves through Puddle's proxy, an ordinary program on this PC, which
            the client handles like any other app. If company resources reached through Global
            Secure Access don't work from a sandbox, this limitation is the likely cause; Puddle
            can't change it.

No problems found; 1 warning to know about. (1.2 s)

